{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0121-s002", "text": "I proven visar den studerande i praktiken att hen kan utföra vissa arbetsuppgifter.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-yrkesutbildning/narration/resume-20261103T042536379032+0000-7/hb-c08-u0121-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.383945578231293, "peak": 0.29656982421875, "generation_seconds": 24.128767902962863, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0121-s003", "text": "Genom det visar hen hur väl hen uppnår den viktiga yrkesskicklighet eller -kompetens som fastställs i grunderna för examen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-yrkesutbildning/narration/resume-20261103T042536379032+0000-7/hb-c08-u0121-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.309659863945578, "peak": 0.31610107421875, "generation_seconds": 41.581940381089225, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0122-s001", "text": "För varje prov får den studerande ett intyg, som är en del av examensbetyget.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-yrkesutbildning/narration/resume-20261103T042536379032+0000-7/hb-c08-u0122-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.965986394557823, "peak": 0.291961669921875, "generation_seconds": 24.910428303992376, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0122-s002", "text": "Delarna i en yrkesexamen bedöms på skalan 1–5, där 5 är högst.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-yrkesutbildning/narration/resume-20261103T042536379032+0000-7/hb-c08-u0122-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.896326530612245, "peak": 0.238494873046875, "generation_seconds": 23.220025123097003, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0122-s003", "text": "Gemensamma examensdelar bedöms på skalan godkänd eller underkänd.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-yrkesutbildning/narration/resume-20261103T042536379032+0000-7/hb-c08-u0122-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.921088435374149, "peak": 0.270751953125, "generation_seconds": 22.179151076823473, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0123-s001", "text": "Det är möjligt att avlägga gymnasiets studentexamen och en yrkesinriktad grundexamen inom samma studier.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-yrkesutbildning/narration/resume-20261103T042536379032+0000-7/hb-c08-u0123-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.986122448979591, "peak": 0.260711669921875, "generation_seconds": 31.725104487035424, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0123-s002", "text": "Då pratar man om en dubbelexamen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-yrkesutbildning/narration/resume-20261103T042536379032+0000-7/hb-c08-u0123-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.2043537414965986, "peak": 0.295318603515625, "generation_seconds": 12.276533090043813, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0123-s003", "text": "Gymnasiestudierna avläggs ofta på ett vuxengymnasium så att man studerar gymnasieämnen två dagar i veckan.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-yrkesutbildning/narration/resume-20261103T042536379032+0000-7/hb-c08-u0123-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.47374149659864, "peak": 0.3389892578125, "generation_seconds": 31.858159427996725, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
